        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Pele de Rocha. Larvitar nasce nas profundezas do subsolo e se transforma em pupa depois de comer uma quantidade de terra equivalente a uma montanha. Ele não consegue chegar à superfície antes de consumir completamente todo o solo ao redor.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Monstro &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Larvitar pode evoluir para Pupitar no nível 10 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Bite, Leer, Rock Throw, Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Sandstorm</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Screech</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Chip Away</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Stomping Tantrum</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Rock Slide</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Scary Face, Smack Down</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Thrash</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Dark Pulse</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Payback</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Crunch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Earthquake, Stone Edge</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Hyper Beam</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Assurance, Attract, Body Slam, Brick Break, Bulldoze, Confide, Crunch, Curse, Dark Pulse, Dig, Double Team, Double-Edge, Dragon Dance, Earth Power, Earthquake, Endure, Facade, Frustration, Giga Impact, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Hyper Beam, Iron Defense, Iron Head, Iron Tail, Mud Shot, Mud-Slap, Outrage, Payback, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Retaliate, Return, Rock Blast, Rock Polish, Rock Slide, Rock Tomb, Round, Sand Tomb, Sandstorm, Scary Face, Screech, Sleep Talk, Smack Down, Snarl, Snore, Spite, Stealth Rock, Stomping Tantrum, Stone Edge, Substitute, Sunny Day, Superpower, Swagger, Take Down, Taunt, Tera Blast, Torment, Toxic, Uproar</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Ancient Power, Assurance, Curse, Dragon Dance, Focus Energy, Iron Defense, Iron Head, Iron Tail, Outrage, Pursuit, Stealth Rock, Stomp</p>",
